{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_8b51029a9c8d4e82abe64bc95b4cf5af","id":"pg_3eb4babad0a454d890465fdd588d7670","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-ourocodus-prd-md-00bfe36ef930-5fdd588d7670.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_868f4c77dc2a51faae20be3555813197"],"title":"2389-research/ourocodus/PRD.md @ 00bfe36ef930","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8b51029a9c8d4e82abe64bc95b4cf5af"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0480c25b52d33b5fbdda40c1ef3b3a383e561a89b9eefffbf46288b2e3978741"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Each AgentSession has three isolation layers (git worktree, read-only credentials, Docker container) orchestrated by an AgentContainerLauncher."},{"claim_ids":["clm_750f941f7ad8c7803cba3d1d6a3997e3781df6d1a7567df52c47f03c262d9f08"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The relay spawns multiple concurrent agents with user-chosen identifiers; agents can be spawned or terminated independently, and one agent's failure does not terminate the session."},{"claim_ids":["clm_796bcf743257a469b337f9591a1331a8b564054489e3dd088da95d749bebdeab"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is at Phase 1 (foundation/proof of concept) focused on validating multi-agent communication and concurrent isolated work; the PWA client is planned while demos exist currently."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0480c25b52d33b5fbdda40c1ef3b3a383e561a89b9eefffbf46288b2e3978741","clm_750f941f7ad8c7803cba3d1d6a3997e3781df6d1a7567df52c47f03c262d9f08","clm_796bcf743257a469b337f9591a1331a8b564054489e3dd088da95d749bebdeab"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_8b51029a9c8d4e82abe64bc95b4cf5af","id":"pg_7eec3232543e5e658143c3fd0c6c3699","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-ourocodus-docs-architecture-architecture-md-00bfe36ef930-c3fd0c6c3699.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_b3744b94d16c521ca1982b5bef9d4bd2"],"title":"2389-research/ourocodus/docs/architecture/ARCHITECTURE.md @ 00bfe36ef930","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8b51029a9c8d4e82abe64bc95b4cf5af"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1b34a7debc1311954e67f6d350aa3217f5b96375723b93cfe74a8f3516d92fa1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The API spec defines structured error responses with codes such as SESSION_NOT_FOUND, and the demo documentation distinguishes recoverable from non-recoverable errors."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3a6490b051ee68bd24de91a39b06e745905e262aa75aa0d5a1637348db93426d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors are directed to install mise, run mise install, and work through GitHub issues ordered by dependency with acceptance criteria."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5864c5808c2f2a626db14eb782ec691ab791a6fc411af0065903433a1c950661"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repository layout includes a relay WebSocket server, a CLI, an echo test agent under cmd/, shared packages in pkg/, and a PWA frontend in web/."},{"claim_ids":["clm_623b889fee4087df44caf926c9d42cf08f0cd65157303b41bdab7db9cf23edbc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: CI runs two GitHub Actions workflows on PRs and pushes to main, covering builds, go test, golangci-lint, gofmt, shellcheck, and smoke/integration tests; optional pre-commit hooks run gofumpt, go vet, and go mod tidy."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6ca9db23a40886b306ffcb0c64a36667da03806f4990a6f5a7d7dd9dfa96eb26"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented dependencies include the Docker SDK for Go (Apache 2.0) for container lifecycle management and the NATS Go client, with the API built on Go's net/http stdlib."},{"claim_ids":["clm_70e1749ccdeef560e19181e7a5c2f6ccede8259c96aac66937cc5b1a0b0de85b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"When NATS is enabled, the system auto-creates SESSION_EVENTS and WORK_RESULTS JetStream streams with 7-day retention and 100K message limits, using a documented topic naming convention."},{"claim_ids":["clm_750f941f7ad8c7803cba3d1d6a3997e3781df6d1a7567df52c47f03c262d9f08"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The relay spawns multiple concurrent agents with user-chosen identifiers; agents can be spawned or terminated independently, and one agent's failure does not terminate the session."},{"claim_ids":["clm_796bcf743257a469b337f9591a1331a8b564054489e3dd088da95d749bebdeab"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is at Phase 1 (foundation/proof of concept) focused on validating multi-agent communication and concurrent isolated work; the PWA client is planned while demos exist currently."},{"claim_ids":["clm_796d8b7b321878d6eff9da073d865a4e2f3aface18ad3d66cbc4b002edf31b95"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Container sessions validate workspace mount points to prevent directory traversal, ensuring workspace paths stay under the configured base directory when attaching to existing containers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8af410e0187b521fa235b3e804ce457539f72784d64ff2707cc4688db3699ed2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"ACP processes can run as host processes via os/exec (default) or inside agent containers via docker exec, selected by the OUROCODUS_ACP_RUNTIME variable."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9939537d833031f7b1ea9333f9e711c4610755952b714cd6de4a250a36b4c2a7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An interactive REPL demo supports session creation, agent spawning, messaging, and agent listing without requiring an API key by using an echo agent."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c8ac75b6036b3b660bfcf3dc86967612a64469290afeb3ade3db91b39b914034"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"NATS with JetStream is optional for event logging; when NATS_URL is unset the relay logs events to stdout and works without it."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1b34a7debc1311954e67f6d350aa3217f5b96375723b93cfe74a8f3516d92fa1","clm_3a6490b051ee68bd24de91a39b06e745905e262aa75aa0d5a1637348db93426d","clm_5864c5808c2f2a626db14eb782ec691ab791a6fc411af0065903433a1c950661","clm_623b889fee4087df44caf926c9d42cf08f0cd65157303b41bdab7db9cf23edbc","clm_6ca9db23a40886b306ffcb0c64a36667da03806f4990a6f5a7d7dd9dfa96eb26","clm_70e1749ccdeef560e19181e7a5c2f6ccede8259c96aac66937cc5b1a0b0de85b","clm_750f941f7ad8c7803cba3d1d6a3997e3781df6d1a7567df52c47f03c262d9f08","clm_796bcf743257a469b337f9591a1331a8b564054489e3dd088da95d749bebdeab","clm_796d8b7b321878d6eff9da073d865a4e2f3aface18ad3d66cbc4b002edf31b95","clm_8af410e0187b521fa235b3e804ce457539f72784d64ff2707cc4688db3699ed2","clm_9939537d833031f7b1ea9333f9e711c4610755952b714cd6de4a250a36b4c2a7","clm_c8ac75b6036b3b660bfcf3dc86967612a64469290afeb3ade3db91b39b914034"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_8b51029a9c8d4e82abe64bc95b4cf5af","id":"pg_99c328c4da0056ddbe7cced2a4de1a04","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-ourocodus-readme-md-00bfe36ef930-ced2a4de1a04.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_5336c2953aa0548eb9f3e091a7b50930"],"title":"2389-research/ourocodus/README.md @ 00bfe36ef930","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8b51029a9c8d4e82abe64bc95b4cf5af"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1b34a7debc1311954e67f6d350aa3217f5b96375723b93cfe74a8f3516d92fa1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The API spec defines structured error responses with codes such as SESSION_NOT_FOUND, and the demo documentation distinguishes recoverable from non-recoverable errors."},{"claim_ids":["clm_24df3fd603b4e4051167965eea00be03f2d866c6725924ce96854268bffb6d79"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The PRD specifies an HTTP control plane providing REST endpoints for session management, agent lifecycle, event log access, health checks, and serving static web UI files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_44433d7a980c1e24c96eff57ece50b171a39671aceae7ac5290c69099536242e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The documented REST API includes POST/GET/DELETE /api/sessions, GET /api/agents, event tailing and SSE streaming at /api/events, plus /health and /api/info endpoints."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6ca9db23a40886b306ffcb0c64a36667da03806f4990a6f5a7d7dd9dfa96eb26"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented dependencies include the Docker SDK for Go (Apache 2.0) for container lifecycle management and the NATS Go client, with the API built on Go's net/http stdlib."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b7ca3efcea9d777902b74df8b5c7e0ce56435235d244deacd8b9eb72189eddd2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The API server uses in-memory state with reconstruction from an event log at startup, reconnecting to NATS and Docker and querying running agent containers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bcaae0760238d545f6457ef2dcbd0ea9967782595481669884629ec568cf9b16"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The PRD specifies Session, Agent, and Event data models with JSON fields including status, container_id, chunks_completed, and payload."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e3e9ce81b66270048c886d8b46679c1d102e1292668bf76c906b2a06877121af"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The API spec states the POC has no authentication, is localhost-only, and allows all CORS origins, with API keys, CORS config, and rate limiting deferred to post-POC."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1b34a7debc1311954e67f6d350aa3217f5b96375723b93cfe74a8f3516d92fa1","clm_24df3fd603b4e4051167965eea00be03f2d866c6725924ce96854268bffb6d79","clm_44433d7a980c1e24c96eff57ece50b171a39671aceae7ac5290c69099536242e","clm_6ca9db23a40886b306ffcb0c64a36667da03806f4990a6f5a7d7dd9dfa96eb26","clm_b7ca3efcea9d777902b74df8b5c7e0ce56435235d244deacd8b9eb72189eddd2","clm_bcaae0760238d545f6457ef2dcbd0ea9967782595481669884629ec568cf9b16","clm_e3e9ce81b66270048c886d8b46679c1d102e1292668bf76c906b2a06877121af"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_8b51029a9c8d4e82abe64bc95b4cf5af","id":"pg_e14046f319e358d6b2846d031c47e402","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-ourocodus-docs-prd-api-md-00bfe36ef930-6d031c47e402.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_2f36a4df46f757ec8941ce6a660fd238"],"title":"2389-research/ourocodus/docs/prd/api.md @ 00bfe36ef930","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8b51029a9c8d4e82abe64bc95b4cf5af"}
